{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Valued Volunteer,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you in advance for your willingness to test the Aberration Loop. Your participation is instrumental in advancing our understanding of this groundbreaking technology. By volunteering your time and efforts, you are helping us gather invaluable insights that will propel scientific progress and innovation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We deeply appreciate your support and trust in our vision. Your contribution is a vital step toward a brighter, more advanced tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gratitude,<br>A-OK Labs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/8581f97807907c53abc667d7db797393.poster.avif?t=1773039925\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/8581f97807907c53abc667d7db797393.webm?t=1773039925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/8581f97807907c53abc667d7db797393.mp4?t=1773039925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office Aberrations takes between 30 and 120 minutes to complete on average.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/31c92191a131045eec3739d52d482c8c.poster.avif?t=1773039925\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/31c92191a131045eec3739d52d482c8c.webm?t=1773039925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/31c92191a131045eec3739d52d482c8c.mp4?t=1773039925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover over 50 aberrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock additional areas as you explore for increased difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice-acted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect aberrant items and return them to the Aberrant Item Room (AIR)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/a95d6c1286932f2a9307546a46773280.poster.avif?t=1773039925\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/a95d6c1286932f2a9307546a46773280.webm?t=1773039925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/extras/a95d6c1286932f2a9307546a46773280.mp4?t=1773039925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157670?t=1773039925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/1a1fcbc1a6826c5878cce04197ad1a02fdcc749e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773039925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/49aeaaa15d8a320e6203f7a83027f875bbc5d49d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773039925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157670/49aeaaa15d8a320e6203f7a83027f875bbc5d49d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773039925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"des